    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for all line styles. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Subclasses control whether a line is drawn (<computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineStyle_1a3106ef5605632587110a4f226edd6c78" kindref="member">showLine()</ref></computeroutput>) and supply dash parameters to the renderer via <computeroutput><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineStyle_1a1df16150df3d29aac2896828084334ab" kindref="member">dashParameters()</ref></computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1SolidLine" kindref="compound">SolidLine</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1NoLine" kindref="compound">NoLine</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1DashLine" kindref="compound">DashLine</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
